SUMMARY:Historic Manassas Farmers Market (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:The Historic Manassas Farmers Market Has Returned!  \nJoin us rain or shine every Thursday and Saturday and stock up on farm-fresh produce\, local meats & cheeses\, baked goods\, artisan crafts\, and more! And even more good news! Use SNAP/EBT at the market and get FREE fruits & vegetables through our SNAP & Virginia Fresh Match program. \nVisit https://historicmanassas.org/farmers-market/ for vendor lineups\, programming\, and performers\, and follow Historic Manassas Farmers Market on Facebook and Instagram for updates. \n📅 Saturdays | April 11 – November 21⏰ 8 AM – 1 PM📍 Commuter Lot\, 9024 Prince William St.\, Manassas\, VA \n📅 Thursdays | April 9 – October 29⏰ 8 AM – 1 PM📍 Harris Pavilion\, 9201 Center St.\, Manassas\, VA
URL:https://historicmanassas.org/event/historic-manassas-farmers-market-saturdays/2026-10-31/
LOCATION:9024 Prince William St. Manassas\, VA. 20110\, 9024 Prince William St.\, Manassas\, Virginia\, 20110\, United States
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Farmers' Market
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://historicmanassas.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/HMI-FM-General-Info-Web.png
END:VEVENT
