SUMMARY:ARTfactory's Holiday Market
DESCRIPTION:ARTfactory's Holiday Market\n\nJoin us at our Holiday Market for a festive day of shopping\, community\, and holiday cheer! Browse a variety of unique gifts\, seasonal décor\, handmade crafts\, and treats from local vendors while enjoying the warm spirit of the season.\n\nGuests will also have the opportunity to participate in a special raffle giveaway featuring beautifully assembled gift baskets filled with generous donations from local businesses\, organizations\, and community members. Each basket offers an exciting collection of items\, making the raffle a fun way to support the event while having a chance to win wonderful prizes.\nCome celebrate the season with family and friends and help make this holiday gathering a memorable occasion for all.\n\nCurrently Accepting Donations & Vendor Applications\n\nWe are currently accepting donations for our raffle baskets and welcome contributions from local businesses\, organizations\, and community members. Donations may include individual items to be added to a themed basket or an entire completed basket for the raffle. We are also seeking vendors interested in participating in the Holiday Market. If you would like to showcase your products\, crafts\, or services\, vendor applications are now available. Your support and participation help create a festive community event while promoting local businesses and organizations. For more information on donating raffle items or becoming a vendor\, visit https://virginiaartfactory.org/holiday-market/
URL:https://historicmanassas.org/event/artfactorys-holiday-market/2026-12-04/
LOCATION:ARTfactory (9419 Battle St.\, Manassas\, VA 20110)\, 9419 Battle Street\, Manassas\, VA\, 20110\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://historicmanassas.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Holiday-Market-2026-Tablet-Graphic.png
ORGANIZER;CN="ARTfactory":MAILTO:jexum@VirginiaARTfactory.org
END:VEVENT
