SUMMARY:Finding Neverland
DESCRIPTION:Pied Piper Theatre\, ARTfactory’s youth theater company\, proudly presents Finding Neverland. \nBased on the beloved story behind Peter Pan\, Finding Neverland follows playwright J.M. Barrie as he discovers the inspiration to create one of the world’s most magical tales. When Barrie meets a spirited widow and her four imaginative sons\, he is reminded of the wonder\, courage\, and possibility that live inside childhood. Filled with heart humor and soaring music\, this enchanting musical celebrates the power of imagination\, the importance of family\, and the bravery it takes to believe in something extraordinary.  \nPerformances will be held in the Gregory Family Theater at Hylton Performing Arts Center in Manassas on January 15 at 7PM\, January 16 at 2 & 7PM\, and January 17 at 2PM.  \nFINDING NEVERLAND is presented through special arrangement with Music Theatre International (MTI). All authorized performance materials are also supplied by MTI. www.mtishows.com \nThis production is supported in part by Iron Horse Foundation.
URL:https://historicmanassas.org/event/finding-neverland/
LOCATION:Gregory Family Theater At Hylton Performing Arts Center\, 10960 GEORGE MASON CIR\, Manassas\, VA\, 20110\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://historicmanassas.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Finding-Neverland-TICKET-GRAPHIC.png
ORGANIZER;CN="ARTfactory":MAILTO:jexum@VirginiaARTfactory.org
END:VEVENT
